# The Queen Ant (29001), a level 1 grand boss in her npcmaker's territory, hit by the level 10
# character 100 in front of her, every draw 0: more than 8 levels above her, it makes her want
# her curse 4515 on it and drop her hate of it; then, as for any playable, her self cast 4017
# and the attack by the damage. The curse, instant, lands on the character at once (aborting
# its action twice); the character, her top desire target now and beyond her aggro range, fails
# her automatic attack check, so she drops her hate of it again, and the attack desire with it.
# Her curse's landing roll is pinned to 0 (roll line): the landing rate is at most 99 of 100, so an
# unpinned roll would leave the character unaffected one run in a hundred.
character Hunter 10
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.queenant.QueenAnt
territory nest 150 -200 900 200 -100 100
npc queen 29001 GrandBoss 700 0 0 maker nest skill BUFF 4017 1 skill DD_MAGIC 4018 1 skill DD_MAGIC_A 4019 1 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill DEBUFF_A 4215 1
roll queen 0

approach queen
hit queen 22
  S MagicSkillUse caster=queen target=player skill=4515-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4515,1
  desires queen cast(player,4515,move)=1000000 cast(queen,4017)=1000000
